      "content": "build from the ashes? there's nothing left to build with. my reputation is radioactive. no one wants to be near me, and even my own family looks at me like i'm some kind of warning sign. it's not just a setback, it's a permanent erasure. i can't go back to who i was, and i can't stand being this version of myself.",
